y":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T12:13:04-07:00","id":612487,"title":"","content":"Auspice dice? I don't remember this, but then again, I preferred colored 10-siders that I got from The Dice Shop. I loves me my sets of Chessex Teal Frosted, Chessex Carribean Blue, Chessex Velvet Black and Chessex Translucent Teal dice. 40 dice in total and they're all friggin' gorgeous. Yes, I like the color teal, why do you ask? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (As you have no doubt noticed, I'm a big fan of Chessex dice. None of this &quot;6.&quot; or &quot;9.&quot; instead of &quot;<u>6</u>&quot; and &quot;<u>9</u>&quot; for me. I hate those damned dots! They're so asymetrical!)<br /> <br /> But yeah, I'm curious to know what these auspice dice look like. I assume they're 10-siders, of course. Does anyone have a screenshot of them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 08-02-2015, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T15:40:21-07:00","id":612722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/610728-i-need-dice?p=611940#post611940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel your pain. I had 80 of my original Werewolf dice stolen years ago. These days I'm down to one Auspice die and 4 originals.<br /> I've been unable to find ANYONE willing to part with their original sets, so few years ago I had the 0-9 dice recreated and sold them. I didn't have the Auspice dice recreated because of trademark and cost reasons.<br /> I thought that I had sold out of them, but I found a few sets in an unpacked bag a few months ago. Again, they're just the D10s, not the Auspice dice, but they're pretty close.<br /> <br /> Rich has also put out a request for folks to tell him what dice they'd like to see created again on <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/onyx-paths-stuffy-dolls-and-gen-con-indy-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">the latest Monday Meeting Notes</a>, so if you'd like to see the original dice remade, shout out to him! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well that sounds promising at least. More promising than the last set of those dice I found on some well known online shop going for about $200.00......<br /> <br /> How about this, the old fashion rust colouration for <b>Gaia</b> and some sickly green colour for <b>Wyrm</b>. Come to think of it, I think the rust colour was inspired by the <b>Pnetex</b> imagery used to decorate the cover of second edition.<br /> <br /> Anywa, looking forward to buying more dice, or finding more on floor of my room after a clean up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T22:01:17-07:00","id":613024,"title":"","content":"Well someone is selling a set of Mage dice on Amazon for the low price of $2000.00","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T22:09:35-07:00","id":613028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowlost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/610728-i-need-dice?p=613024#post613024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-